{"id":71211,"date":"2026-10-28T09:47:30","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:47:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71211"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:53:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:53:27","slug":"corrida-dos-reis-marinhais","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-dos-reis-marinhais\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa Corrida dos Reis &#8211; Marinhais 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa Corrida dos Reis - Marinhais 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">2\u00aa Corrida dos Reis - Marinhais 2027<\/strong> realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">3 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Complexo Desportivo Municipal de Marinhais<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Salvaterra de Magos<\/strong> (distrito de Santar\u00e9m). Abrindo o calend\u00e1rio de corridas de estrada do novo ano na regi\u00e3o da Lez\u00edria do Tejo, a prova conjuga dist\u00e2ncias cronometradas em asfalto plano com vertentes para jovens e fam\u00edlias. Planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais desafios no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/provas-de-estrada\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Provas de Estrada em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:00<\/strong> com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida das Crian\u00e7as<\/strong> nas imedia\u00e7\u00f5es da Rua Manuel Sebasti\u00e3o Marques, dividida por quatro escal\u00f5es: Bambis (300 m), Benjamins A (500 m), Benjamins B (700 m) e Infantis (1000 m). Seguem-se as provas principais pelas art\u00e9rias de Marinhais (Rua Fernando Pessoa, Estrada Militar, Quinta da Sardinha e Rua do Olival): a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida de 9 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>, exclusiva para maiores de 18 anos), a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:15<\/strong>, aberta a partir dos 12 anos) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:30<\/strong>), com tempo limite global de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">2h00<\/strong> (encerramento \u00e0s 12:00).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Grupo Desportivo de Marinhais<\/strong> em parceria com a sec\u00e7\u00e3o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Tarde Desportiva Runners<\/strong>, e com o apoio institucional da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Salvaterra de Magos e da Junta de Freguesia de Marinhais, a prova atribui medalha Finisher a todos os participantes, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica nas provas de 9 km, 5 km e Caminhada, e trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros da geral e de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (Sub-18 a M60\/F60) nas corridas de 9 km e 5 km. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);