2, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 15\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/12 a 23\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 2\u00aa Corrida dos Reis - Marinhais 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Corrida dos Reis realiza-se no domingo, 3 de janeiro de 2027, com partidas e chegadas no Complexo Desportivo Municipal de Marinhais, no concelho de Salvaterra de Magos (distrito de Santar\u00e9m).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09:00 com a Corrida das Crian\u00e7as (Bambis 300 m, Benjamins A 500 m, Benjamins B 700 m e Infantis 1000 m), seguida \u00e0s 10:00 pela Corrida de 9 km, \u00e0s 10:15 pela Mini Corrida de 5 km e \u00e0s 10:30 pela Caminhada de 5 km. O tempo m\u00e1ximo de prova \u00e9 de 2h00 (encerra \u00e0s 12:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da 2\u00aa Corrida dos Reis - Marinhais 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 23 de dezembro de 2026 em tr\u00eas fases (at\u00e9 30\/11, de 01\/12 a 15\/12 e de 16\/12 a 23\/12): Corrida 9 km (9,00 \u20ac \/ 10,00 \u20ac \/ 12,00 \u20ac), Mini Corrida 5 km (8,00 \u20ac \/ 9,00 \u20ac \/ 10,00 \u20ac), Caminhada (7,00 \u20ac \/ 8,00 \u20ac \/ 9,00 \u20ac) e Corrida das Crian\u00e7as (3,00 \u20ac em qualquer fase).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e quando \u00e9 entregue?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit da Corrida de 9 km e da Mini Corrida de 5 km inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal e chip de cronometragem; o da Caminhada inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e dorsal; e o da Corrida das Crian\u00e7as inclui dorsal. Todos os finalistas recebem medalha Finisher. A entrega dos kits realiza-se no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (3 de janeiro), a partir das 07:30, no Complexo Desportivo Municipal de Marinhais.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e quais s\u00e3o as idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Grupo Desportivo de Marinhais e pela sec\u00e7\u00e3o Tarde Desportiva Runners, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Salvaterra de Magos e da Junta de Freguesia de Marinhais. A Corrida de 9 km destina-se a maiores de 18 anos, a Mini Corrida de 5 km e a Caminhada aceitam atletas a partir dos 12 anos, e a Corrida das Crian\u00e7as abrange escal\u00f5es dos 6 aos 11 anos.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2\u00aa Corrida dos Reis - Marinhais 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-03\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAtten